**Strengths:** The respondent demonstrates sophisticated emotional intelligence, particularly in recognizing when to shift from advice-giving to presence-offering. The debrief shows exceptional metacognitive awareness and willingness to critique their own performance. Warmth and safety-consciousness are consistent throughout.

